(column And 0 0 0 1) (column Andn 0 0 1 0) (column Fst 0 0 1 1) (column Nand 1 1 1 0)
(column Nfst 1 1 0 0) (column Nor 1 0 0 0) (column Nsnd 1 0 1 0) (column One 1 1 1 1)
(column Or 0 1 1 1) (column Orn 1 0 1 1) (column Randn 0 1 0 0) (column Rorn 1 1 0 1)
(column Snd 0 1 0 1) (column Xnor 1 0 0 1) (column Xor 0 1 1 0) (column Zero 0 0 0 0)
